l reshaping.','unresolved_decisions':['Steel grade, purchased dimensions/tolerances, members, joints and reinforcement details TBD.'],'dependent_source_rules':[],'source_clauses':[['F.3.4.1:p001','23e4b5fdaffcec2ae2f01ce56f4be24e03afdec08ed09c794e66d1f9a0eca8e2'],['F.3.4.1:p002','30819860702c77667887032537fc5bffe4c320405efe83168f3af2da5c371d1b'],['F.3.4.1:p003','479daf8313eb197d69606cd4ef76b91128a9f5cb75104d287e4f53bec21c96ee'],['F.3.4.1:p004','7c71b0e7a306bb4c8718e2eeae6a55ed3c9ee170810387224cd874bd7d7b4e84'],['F.3.4.1:p005','766303dabacbe6d2d14863e86d1b043c45314d24fb8421451cf4414227327475'],['F.3.4.1:p006','d792a9e3771b09f1a3390d9c285e4be85886afd0757ac712e666af1a596a2bdd'],['F.3.4.1:p007','7666e923449cf34a7b5166469339c210d37a8f434bc59fc7d1f8689ebf4015d8'],['F.3.4.2:p001','79889c32eb1084885668554b2efcb18471acc8e71303a1237e3664a50ff16dd3'],['F.3.4.2:p002','078174e77f4ac322dfe16ef7783f7183c7b125d321c8c99af8ec9d8a2812f2e6'],['F.3.4.2:p003','3f51a049096d3bd72cf707862fba945f65ad20e9bcf49c97f60be744ca59a576'],['F.3.4.2:p004','95862f47c8f8ae0ab7a33f8013966609a9e957be0d1888f60094654c976141f9'],['F.3.4.2:p005','5f3e753b16228bf5ccf540f6c7ad7feac5a2a3f0fcb682a562e2d7c1eb89be86'],['F.3.4.2:p006','c6d89cf81b645a6d0060f99db0fe5d5f280937c2a359a11d42aff1668642bdda'],['F.3.4.2:p007','1775c0cf857621712b4aa35dbebd22c96df3963fd009a127094e649ead78a420'],['F.3.4.2:p008','91d7baef5aefbe20ddb3549be9c4f5f659585e315db865d69e62a431b80047ef'],['F.3.4.3:p001','add0ae866310c0508ca7d31e05f11847e2493cf9219d82f841ccc5e48ed9bb5c'],['F.3.4.3:p002','dd1ac8bf8995c4b5dd342ad106ee94acd693835e55fa0af968fc578f5743e484'],['F.3.4.3:p003','fb42d0fd5fed3a0ed7afb845eb5536baa6b57396acce385b710f7ac321e12a88'],['F.3.4.3:p004','4b5cd1676d1a966ebeae33922e3358924318f8acb34ea92c54e9501f0baf8377'],['F.3.4.3:p005','64ea6c98ea3bf3981a0d003041554c3ba8a1b50722bda1e31bdab02b2f0479ef'],['F.3.4.3:p006','b59881306fe12b84a09397b2d71c5ea8f908debae1fc5b150bbb32192186ada4'],['F.3.4.4:p001','b60c86c4152a06ca873fde0e2c6e6a035fd462e70940b1be26c56d2fbc82e313']]],['key':'ALUMINUM','identifier':'FSAE2027:VP:obligation:ALUMINUM','title':'Retain conditional aluminum construction and evidence','model_keys':['loadpath','side','front'],'statement':'Use aluminum tubing only in applications permitted by the application table. The SES includes material identity/properties with purchase, shipping or donation evidence, equivalence calculations against the steel minima/nonwelded reference in yield/ultimate bending, buckling, tension, buckling modulus and energy dissipation, plus manufacturing process details. Aluminum wall minima are 2.0 mm nonwelded and 3.0 mm welded. SES nonwelded 6061-T6 values are E=69 GPa(10000 ksi), Sy=240 MPa(34.8 ksi), Su=290 MPa(42.1 ksi); welded values Sy=115 MPa(16.7 ksi), Su=175 MPa(25.4 ksi). Use the alloy\'s as-welded equivalent yield strength unless detailed proof establishes correct solution treatment/artificial aging and absence of later manufacturing heating. Postweld strengthening evidence identifies the facility, process and fixturing.','conditions_and_alternatives':['Only if aluminum is selected; no aluminum material or heat-treatment waiver is selected.'],'verification_obligation':'Audit material provenance, thicknesses, manufacturing records, reference-property use and every equivalence mode. If claiming postweld strength recovery, review complete treatment/fixturing/thermal history evidence.','unresolved_decisions':['Aluminum applicability, alloy, welding and heat-treatment choices TBD.'],'dependent_source_rules':[],'source_clauses':[['F.3.5.1:p001','db275ddcf7ebe5d2727066344426e2ae83dec992d84c92d5ca9feeb8e325e931'],['F.3.5.2:p001','cd131a7ca539c613218b144a77accb0c771f801bf3bea79f9bb121a095f88027'],['F.3.5.2:p002','27a9b3b3698550072c51d8886fccbff8a53b7c54ab431a5c164d51ee79fc0258'],['F.3.5.2:p003','728127fe25ed2d56f819d3b4b67c32c5beb767aa7f7206c8052b706d9163c816'],['F.3.5.2:p004','7b61729038bedb31eeea0eeadae1ed837bc2a28e48de50c829c54b9a28e0a5a8'],['F.3.5.3:p001','ae43