ide profile exceeds 400 mm by 350 mm or standard honeycomb is used, provide a full-opening diagonal/X support of class C or equivalent for monocoques, with each end carrying at least 30 kN in any direction, or perform F.8.8.6/.7 tests proving permanent AIP deflection is at most 25 mm.','conditions_and_alternatives':['Standard/custom, foam/honeycomb/other, bulkhead profile and support/test alternatives remain unresolved.'],'verification_obligation':'Pin the event-site approval/specification if standard is chosen; otherwise inspect custom dimensions/segments and obtain applicable tests. Evaluate the bulkhead/honeycomb trigger and establish the selected support or physical-test alternative.','unresolved_decisions':['Exact approved standard IA or custom construction, bulkhead size and additional support/test choice TBD.'],'dependent_source_rules':['F.2.3.1','F.8.8.6','F.8.8.7'],'source_clauses':[['F.8.4.1:p001','d07f8f8bebbdfb9552ce7eb9d16851d514041394de8f8f8ccd6a02312ad82ee0'],['F.8.4.1:p002','86c229fcef3c31ebf7a4f51436055d8d9826ec26eec890286dcd09216e1d0496'],['F.8.4.1:p003','ac06ab6fc900820f6e1944983863836090a866b8d8850240bc401ae9f0f47feb'],['F.8.4.2:p001','102777dcd52a6aaa448771c2bfd2330095e6c62f931e2913d9c7abec0b20ef0e'],['F.8.4.2:p002','92dbca2f5acac45c01fe7cad66586e9cf11426e0a62dde8ef744dee85b3f8e43'],['F.8.4.2:p003','f265f8e03b9c960b03e209f955a2ed05a98f1e2e812f3cb9d025c326b24d600b'],['F.8.4.2:p004','07249efa442f36ccf61c7e5fd68ccdb2a6e77b0b6f8c945d7dc8e6615a64fca9'],['F.8.4.2:p005','4da6cd27c42e31dcdda57e816bbcf735d2f9ba51e36b12f986d3bf522c6d2157'],['F.8.4.3:p001','6b2aa7504fbbcb4ad07b3ed63d27765235e810388c975f189d8e375a507b9813'],['F.8.4.3:p002','5a65d5cef8977a5bd4012eb701cb2287c0e3da0dc911e058bc63d9bbe0be11a7'],['F.8.4.3:p003','3c0027cf098f28d36025a34e40b2b0ff400f92b03bf6412473b0e2c0485e2d32'],['F.8.4.3:p004','72d3f6a622d2e4e5534e598384b27a2116dd8d2970dc0ec3f9b2f9b20f28cce1'],['F.8.4.3:p005','df121e5de5306d71747ef4377e66dbc10a9a5f54e244012f04593d15bfb69131']]],['key':'IA-ATTACHMENT','identifier':'FSAE2027:VP:obligation:IA-ATTACHMENT','title':'Constrain attenuator attachment and position','model_keys':['front','loadpath','pedal'],'statement':'Document IA attachment in SES. Standard/custom foam or honeycomb attaches by bonding; custom other construction may bond, weld or bolt. Bonds satisfy F.5.5 and shear strength strictly exceeds every applicable threshold:95 kN for foam,38.5 kN for honeycomb, and the maximum compressive force for a custom IA. Bond all foam surface; only precrushed honeycomb area counts for bond equivalence. Welds may be continuous/interrupted; interrupted ratio is at least 1:1 and each length is strictly greater than 25 mm. Bolting directly to primary structure uses at least eight critical fasteners of at least 8 mm or 5/16 in diameter, center separation at least 50 mm and each attachment 15 kN pullout/tearout/bending. Bottom leading edge is at most 175 mm above the lower side-impact structure\'s lowest bottom point. A custom IA has an area at least 200 mm long and 200 mm wide intersecting a ground-parallel plane at or below that 175 mm limit. Center IA laterally; standard honeycomb orientation is 200 mm wide by 100 mm high; standard foam may be lateral or vertical.','conditions_and_alternatives':['IA/AIP choices remain unresolved. Preserve the different inequalities: AIP weld length >=25 mm versus IA weld length >25 mm.'],'verification_obligation':'For the chosen IA variant inspect the allowed attachment, strength/provenance, weld/bolt/bond details, low-mounted area and orientation; include the exact method in SES.','unresolved_decisions':['Attenuator type, attachment strengths, mounting height and orientation TBD.'],'dependent_source_rules':['F.5.5','T.8.2'],'source_clauses':[['F.8.5.1:p001','f68c5829e858b8cb076e8d41ff63bcd22790f598da01877b6beb7ccda37352fd'],['F.8.5.2:p001','285b598fcf39cb6143e293d88184874f98c0516024f42c4b26109e518fa95cf3'],['F.8.5.2:p002','b382b8214e619040191a8cb5b6b76fc413cb8c2cab30a3